--- création : valeur annotée de type space, enregistrée / creation: registered space value
space lib 0 lib
space1 lib space1
1: file binary: space "lib" already exists (use "file binary space delete lib")
1: file binary space delete: unknown space "nope"
--- lien nommé / named link
1 {7 8}
1 2 &*(//lib/,int(u,8),null=0).rec
--- deref sans DATA / without DATA
7 8
--- réécriture de l'adresse / rewrite the address
0102
--- écrire une vraie cible : erreur / writing a real target: error
1: file binary: cannot write the target of field r of H2 into the space lib: leave the link unfollowed (-linkdepth 0) to rewrite its address
--- memory:// : adresses virtuelles et segments / virtual addresses and segments
{7 8}
1: file binary: unmapped address 0x2000 in space "mem" (field p of M)
1: file binary: space "mem" is a memory area: write memory://mem/ (field p of Mx)
--- référentiel inconnu / unknown space
1: file binary: unknown space "zzz" (field p of Z)
--- lien anonyme sans DATA / anonymous link without DATA
1: file binary deref: the link "&*(//,int(u,8),null=0).rec" is anonymous: DATA is required
7 8
